=== BACKTEST-TIME IC (does Trade_Score itself rank REAL trades' outcomes, not just beat random on aggregate returns?) ===
  n=4133  backtest_ic=-0.016
  This is a DIFFERENT question from the ALL/TUNE/HOLDOUT sharpe_like/win_rate checks above -- those ask 'does this beat random on aggregate', this asks 'does the score actually rank which specific trades do better or worse'. A strategy can pass the former with ~zero real answer to the latter (see improvements.txt for the real finding that motivated this check).

